# bound-web — environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. `.env*` is gitignored; never
# commit a filled-in copy of this file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Network
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. `@bound/sdk` defaults to `testnet`, which is the only deployment
# that exists. Set it only when a second network is added.
# STELLAR_NETWORK=testnet

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-signed endpoints — the only two secrets this app runs on
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The faucet's own account (`/api/faucet`). A DEDICATED, DISPOSABLE account
# that transfers test USDC out of its own balance. It is NOT the USDC issuer:
# a leak here costs whatever the faucet was holding and is fixed by rotating
# the key, not by re-deploying the token.
#
# `scripts/setup-demo.ts` generates one, funds it, opens its trustline, tops it
# up, and prints the `vercel env add` command.
FAUCET_SECRET=S...

# boundprotocol.dev's own auditor (`/api/attest`). Signs `attest` for visitors
# who will not stand up a second wallet. Its address is already public in
# `@bound/sdk`'s committed deployment record, and every certificate it touches
# carries a disclosure saying it is not an independent third party.
#
# Must match `accounts.auditor` in the committed deployment or the route
# refuses to sign.
AUDITOR_SECRET=S...

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT for the server — local scripts only
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The operator/issuer key. It mints USDC and is the operator of every seeded
# certificate, so a leak is administrative control over the demo token.
#
# `scripts/setup-demo.ts` is the ONLY thing that reads it, it runs locally, and
# it must never be added to Vercel or to CI. No route handler in this app
# touches it.
# OPERATOR_SECRET=S...
